{"head_html": "<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<title>Intelligence Report - Social Media Monitoring</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.3/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n        \n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f8fafc;\n            color: #1e293b;\n        }\n        \n        .sentiment-positive {\n            background-color: #dcfce7;\n            color: #166534;\n        }\n        \n        .sentiment-neutral {\n            background-color: #fef3c7;\n            color: #92400e;\n        }\n        \n        .sentiment-negative {\n            background-color: #fee2e2;\n            color: #b91c1c;\n        }\n        \n        .platform-twitter {\n            border-left: 4px solid #1da1f2;\n        }\n        \n        .platform-instagram {\n            border-left: 4px solid #e1306c;\n        }\n        \n        .platform-facebook {\n            border-left: 4px solid #1877f2;\n        }\n        \n        .platform-youtube {\n            border-left: 4px solid #ff0000;\n        }\n        \n        .platform-whatsapp {\n            border-left: 4px solid #25d366;\n        }\n        \n        .card-shadow {\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n        }\n        \n        .chart-bar {\n            transition: height 0.5s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .section-title {\n            position: relative;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        \n        .section-title::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 3px;\n            background: #3b82f6;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>", "tagged_body_html": "<body class=\"min-h-screen p-6\">\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden\">\n<!-- Header -->\n<header class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white p-6\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">SOCIAL MEDIA INTELLIGENCE REPORT</h1>\n<p class=\"text-gray-300 mt-1\">Real-time monitoring and analysis</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Generated: October 15, 2023</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Period: Last 24 hours</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header>\n<!-- Summary Section -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Executive Summary</h2>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\" data-slot=\"s1\">\n                This report presents a comprehensive analysis of monitored social media activity related to the target topic over the past 24 hours. \n                The monitoring system identified 1,284 posts and mentions across various platforms, with a sentiment distribution favoring neutral content. \n                Key trends and emerging patterns are highlighted for strategic decision-making and operational planning.\n            </p>\n</section>\n<!-- Key Metrics -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Key Metrics Overview</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n<div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600\" data-slot=\"s2\">1,284</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Total Posts &amp; Mentions</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n<div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-green-600\" data-slot=\"s3\">62%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Positive Sentiment</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n<div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-amber-600\" data-slot=\"s4\">28%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Neutral Sentiment</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n<div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-600\" data-slot=\"s5\">10%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Negative Sentiment</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Sentiment Analysis -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Sentiment Analysis</h2>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n<div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-700\">Positive</span>\n<span class=\"font-semibold text-green-600\" data-slot=\"s6\">62%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-green-500 h-4 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 62%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-700\">Neutral</span>\n<span class=\"font-semibold text-amber-600\" data-slot=\"s7\">28%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-amber-500 h-4 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 28%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-700\">Negative</span>\n<span class=\"font-semibold text-red-600\" data-slot=\"s8\">10%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-red-500 h-4 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 10%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg h-full\">\n<h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Sentiment Distribution</h3>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center h-40\">\n<div class=\"relative w-32 h-32\">\n<svg class=\"w-full h-full\" viewbox=\"0 0 36 36\">\n<path d=\"M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path>\n<path d=\"M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-dasharray=\"62, 100\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path>\n<path d=\"M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-dasharray=\"28, 100\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path>\n<path d=\"M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-dasharray=\"10, 100\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-around mt-4\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-green-500 rounded-full mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Positive</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-amber-500 rounded-full mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Neutral</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-red-500 rounded-full mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Negative</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Platform Distribution -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Platform Distribution</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600\" data-slot=\"s9\">38%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Twitter/X</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-pink-600\" data-slot=\"s10\">22%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-700\" data-slot=\"s11\">18%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Facebook</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-red-600\" data-slot=\"s12\">15%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">YouTube</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-green-600\" data-slot=\"s13\">7%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">WhatsApp</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Engagement Metrics -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Engagement Metrics</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600\" data-slot=\"s14\">14,289</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Total Likes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-purple-600\" data-slot=\"s15\">3,421</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Comments</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-green-600\" data-slot=\"s16\">2,893</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Shares</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-orange-600\" data-slot=\"s17\">8,765</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Views</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Top Posts -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Top Posts</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<!-- Post 1 -->\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-r-lg\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">John Smith</span>\n<span class=\"mx-2 text-gray-400\">\u2022</span>\n<span class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Twitter/X</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s18\">Breaking: New community initiative launched to address local safety concerns. Early feedback shows strong community support.</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"sentiment-positive px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\">Positive</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Post 2 -->\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-green-500 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-r-lg\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Sarah Johnson</span>\n<span class=\"mx-2 text-gray-400\">\u2022</span>\n<span class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Instagram</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s19\">Community members gathering to discuss safety protocols. Photos show active participation from residents.</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"sentiment-neutral px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\">Neutral</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Trending Topics -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Trending Topics</h2>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n<span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#CommunitySafety</span>\n<span class=\"bg-green-100 text-green-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#LocalInitiative</span>\n<span class=\"bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#PublicSafety</span>\n<span class=\"bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#CrimePrevention</span>\n<span class=\"bg-red-100 text-red-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#NeighborhoodWatch</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Emerging Trends -->\n<section class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Emerging Trends</h2>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\" data-slot=\"s20\">\n                    Increased discussion around community engagement initiatives and neighborhood watch programs. \n                    Social media users are showing growing interest in collaborative approaches to local safety issues. \n                    Several influencers are beginning to share content related to crime prevention strategies.\n                </p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Intelligence Summary -->\n<section class=\"p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Intelligence Summary</h2>\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\" data-slot=\"s21\">\n                    Monitoring reveals a generally positive sentiment surrounding community safety initiatives. \n                    The platform distribution indicates Twitter/X remains the primary communication channel for \n                    real-time updates and discussions. Engagement metrics show high levels of interaction \n                    around community-focused topics. No immediate threats or concerning patterns were identified \n                    during this monitoring period. Continued surveillance recommended to track evolving sentiments \n                    and potential developments.\n                </p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"p-6 bg-gray-50 text-center text-gray-600 text-sm\">\n<p data-slot=\"s22\">\u00a9 2023 Police Intelligence Monitoring System | Confidential Report</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>", "slots": [{"slot_id": "s1", "slot_type": "freetext", "sample_text": "This report presents a comprehensive analysis of monitored social media activity related to the target topic over the pa", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": null, "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s2", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "1,284", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "total_posts", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s3", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "62%", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "sentiment_counts.positive", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s4", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "28%", "context